			"mark": "TALK_MARK_COMMON",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"喬爾"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 701230101,
					"content": "爸爸到底去哪了……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230102,
					"content": "怎麼了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 701230103,
					"content": "#啊…{F#妳}{M#你}好，我…我找不到我爸爸了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230104,
					"content": "他說好了要接我來雪山看雪的，不過約定的日子到了，他卻一直沒有來接我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230105,
					"content": "我猜，他一定是發現了什麼珍貴秘寶的藏寶圖之類的，所以才沒來找我的，一定是這樣的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230106,
					"content": "我就一個人來雪山了。既然他沒法來找我，我就來找他好了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230107,
					"content": "但是到了這裡，我也沒找到他。那位西風騎士叔叔說，他往山頂上走了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230108,
					"content": "我想自己去找爸爸，但西風騎士叔叔又不讓我去，我就只能留在這裡等爸爸回來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230109,
					"content": "但是…但是他一直沒回來，我還是很擔心他。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230110,
					"content": "#如果{F#妳}{M#你}要進雪山的話，能幫我去找找他嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230111,
						701230112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230111,
					"content": "交給我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 701230113,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}是答應我了吧，太好了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230114,
					"content": "我想想…那位西風騎士叔叔說，爸爸曾經提到過，他要先沿著<color=#00E1FFFF>「覆雪之路」一直往上走</color>…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230115,
					"content": "然後，再去<color=#00E1FFFF>雪山西面的山坡</color>附近看看，最後爸爸說他還想試試<color=#00E1FFFF>登上山頂</color>…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230116,
					"content": "#請{F#妳}{M#你}先去這些地方找找看吧，爸爸說不定會在附近。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230117,
					"content": "他和我約好了一起看雪的，他一定會遵守約定的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230112,
					"content": "去哪找呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230113
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7012302,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7012302
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7012301",
							"3"
						],
						"stepId": 7012301,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_FINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 701230201,
					"content": "到現在為止都很順利，天氣不錯，補給充足，魔物也很安分…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "字跡端正的筆記"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230202,
					"content": "還有，我居然在背包裡發現了一本《野豬公主》第六卷，肯定是喬爾偷偷塞進來的，這孩子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "字跡端正的筆記"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230203,
					"content": "不過這本書講的是一位勇敢的野豬公主和她的朋友登上雪山的故事…正好我也在登雪山，登山的過程這麼順利，說不定就是這本書帶給我好運，多謝啦，喬爾。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "字跡端正的筆記"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230204,
					"content": "總之，我準備接著往下一個營地進發，在那裡補充補給，並且記錄好情況後，我就會下山了，喬爾還在城裡等著我呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "字跡端正的筆記"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7012303,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7012303
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7012302",
							"3"
						],
						"stepId": 7012302,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_FINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 701230301,
					"content": "這一路上沒有出現任何意外，天氣依然很不錯，看來我運氣終於好了一次。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "字跡端正的筆記"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230302,
					"content": "說不定，我可以試試攻頂了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "字跡端正的筆記"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230303,
					"content": "只是稍微試試看，如果出現任何問題，我會馬上退下來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "字跡端正的筆記"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7012304,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7012304
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7012303",
							"3"
						],
						"stepId": 7012303,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_FINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 701230401,
					"content": "山頂上的暴風雪來得太快，我只來得及逃進這個洞穴裡，補給也丟了大半…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "字跡潦草的筆記"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230402,
					"content": "而且不知道什麼原因…洞口上面的石頭突然碎了，落下來的碎石把洞口也封死了，這下真的糟糕了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "字跡潦草的筆記"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230403,
					"content": "但我覺得…還有一條生路。洞口另一邊雖然是懸崖，但下面都是厚厚的雪，如果我能先爬下去一段距離，再往下跳的話…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "字跡潦草的筆記"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230404,
					"content": "補給已經支撐不了幾天了，我必須盡快行動…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "字跡潦草的筆記"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230405,
					"content": "我已經和喬爾約好了要帶他看雪，我不會毀約的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "字跡潦草的筆記"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230406,
					"content": "對了，如果有人看到這本筆記的話，就再幫我在那個食盆裡放點吃的，餵餵那群狐狸吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "字跡潦草的筆記"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230407,
					"content": "我被困在這裡的時候，是那群小傢伙一直陪著我，如果有機會的話，我真想帶著喬爾再來看看牠們…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "字跡潦草的筆記"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7012305,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7012305
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7012305",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7012305,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"喬爾"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 701230501,
					"content": "怎麼樣？有我爸爸的消息了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230502,
						701230511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230502,
					"content": "關於山頂洞窟裡的發現…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230503
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 701230503,
					"content": "爸爸他…不，爸爸是個很厲害的冒險家，這麼點小問題，他一定能解決好的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230504,
					"content": "#爸爸的筆記裡也說了，他已經找到辦法下山了…他肯定已經安全下山了…{F#妳}{M#你}說對吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230505,
					"content": "他應該已經安全下山了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230506
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 701230506,
					"content": "對…他肯定已經安全下山了，現在正在休息呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230507,
					"content": "或者…或者他是在山頂的其他地方建了個新營地休息…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230508,
					"content": "總之，等爸爸休息好了…他就會回來這裡找我了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230509,
					"content": "#我會繼續在這裡等他的，謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}幫我忙，這些東西請{F#妳}{M#你}收下吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230511,
					"content": "什麼都沒找到。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230512
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 701230512,
					"content": "是…這樣嗎？但那位西風騎士叔叔說，爸爸確實進雪山了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230513,
					"content": "也許是他看錯了？或者說…爸爸又去另外的地方建了個新營地…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230514,
					"content": "好吧，那我還是在這裡等著吧…要是爸爸回來的時候找不到我，他一定會很著急。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230515,
					"content": "#謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}幫我忙，這些東西給{F#妳}{M#你}，請收下吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701230516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "喬爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 701230516,
					"content": "爸爸…你到底在哪啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
